  {
   "section": "text",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Our Goal: Your Long-Term Success"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "The digitalization of business models and internal processes is a key factor in all industries today, and there is no one-size-fits-all solution."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "We at diva-e Conclusion know: Every company is unique. That's why we tailor our services to your individual requirements and deliver all the tools you need for digital success from a single source: strategy development, system integration, application management, hosting, data intelligence, digital marketing and long-term optimization."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "We create digital opportunities. For today and tomorrow."
    }
   ],
