  },
  {
   "section": "cards-block",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Digital Consulting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Digital Consulting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "We bring digital and marketing strategies to life! In times of digital change, we ensure that you are always one step ahead of your dynamic market environment. Our customized strategies are your key to a successful digital transformation. As your digital partner, we are at your side with help and advice and bring your goals from theory to practice. Let's get started together to take your business to a new level!"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "/en/services/digital-consulting/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Digital Experience Platform"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Digital Experience Platform"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "With solutions developed in-house or in strategic partnerships with international market leaders: our diva-e Conclusion specialists in the field of digital experience platforms support you throughout the entire project - from start to finish. We analyze your existing system landscape, develop tailor-made applications and network your systems so that they interlock perfectly. In short: we make complex processes simple and efficient - for a digital experience that inspires."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "/en/services/dxp/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Digital Marketing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Digital Marketing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "We support you in increasing your online presence with our performance marketing campaigns. We make you highly visible on all major marketing channels such as Google, Bing, Amazon and other platforms. Our approach? A holistic approach! We measure, analyze and optimize your online marketing. And best of all, we offer you intelligent tools that increase your efficiency and transactions through automation. In short: together we will put your marketing in the fast lane!"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "/en/services/digital-marketing/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Application Management Service"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Application Management Service"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Discover your opportunities with our Application Management Unit! We don't just see ourselves as consultants: we are partners on the way to your business goals. Together, we evaluate individually tailored technology solutions and show you how you can derive concrete benefits from them. We want to open up new digital horizons for you in order to sustainably advance your business."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "/en/services/ams/"
    }
   ],
